					"nextDialogs": [
						400391102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391102,
					"content": "再去幾個人，把船趕緊裝好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391103,
					"content": "都給我停下，東西也都放下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391104,
					"content": "北…北斗姐！您、您怎麼來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391105,
					"content": "溜溜，你在這裡做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391106,
					"content": "哎呀，兄弟們這不是…撞了大運，從海上撈到了點好東西嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391107,
					"content": "北斗姐喜歡什麼，隨便拿！就當是兄弟們孝敬您的，哈哈哈！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391108,
					"content": "是嗎？那這些東西就全都留下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391109,
					"content": "這…這…您多少得講點道上規矩…",
